  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported asynchronous local member-end forces, the Beam steel-ratio task overload, synchronous/asynchronous ratio dictionaries and detached ratio population with matching detailed XML IntelliSense. Added supporting Beam metadata with ID equality, bounded fully qualified ID/reference snapshots and reference-key result ownership. Read all native ratios before population; documented property-handler partial-write limits. Kept settled task APIs on the owning COM thread and retained named force success/failure results, shared binding/lifetime/reentrancy guards and original exceptions. See the member-batch guide for contracts and qualification limits.",
